+# Matches a credit card number with exactly 16 digits in one of three formats:
+# - No separators (16 consecutive digits)
+# - Four groups of four separated by single hyphens
+# - Four groups of four separated by single spaces
+# This type checks textual shape only; it does not validate Luhn checksums,
+# issuers, BIN ranges, or whether a number was issued.
+credit_card = Regex(
+    r"([0-9]{16}|[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{4}|[0-9]{4} [0-9]{4} [0-9]{4} [0-9]{4})"
+)
+
 
